                    General Secretary Brezhnev (8290289,
                    8290342). Secret. Sent for information. Prepared by Stearman. Copied to Bush, Meese, Baker, and Deaver. In the upper right-hand corner of the memorandum,
                        Reagan wrote: “I made some marginal
                    notes. RR.”</p>
            </note>
